text:
Connect an agent
anteroom command

Lets an agent on this Mac do what the app allows; it never publishes or deletes without your confirmation.

Not installed.
Test connection
pip install -e .
Copy

From the vendoo-studio folder, with its virtualenv active, run the install command. Then reopen this page.

Address

Use the local address on this Mac, or the Tailscale address from another machine once Tailscale HTTPS is on.

http://127.0.0.1:4349
Copy
anteroom auth login --alias local --base-url http://127.0.0.1:4349
Copy
Agent apps
Cursor

Cursor → Settings → MCP → New MCP server, or merge this into ~/.cursor/mcp.json.

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "anteroom": {
      "command": "anteroom",
      "args": [
        "mcp",
        "serve"
      ]
    }
  }
}
Copy
Claude Desktop

Claude Desktop → Settings → Developer → Edit Config (~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json). Merge the anteroom entry into mcpServers if that file already has other servers.

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "anteroom": {
      "command": "anteroom",
      "args": [
        "mcp",
        "serve"
      ]
    }
  }
}
Copy
Claude Code

Run the command in a terminal, or merge the JSON into the project's .mcp.json.

claude mcp add --transport stdio anteroom -- anteroom mcp serve
Copy
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "anteroom": {
      "command": "anteroom",
      "args": [
        "mcp",
        "serve"
      ]
    }
  }
}
